        "how_to_enable": "Add X_USERNAME, X_EMAIL and X_PASSWORD to .env (a burner account is strongly advised), install the Python sidecar (npm run setup:python), then run: npm run collect:x",
        "fallback_in_use": "SearXNG `site:x.com OR site:twitter.com` discovery supplies partial X coverage without credentials. Search engines index only a fraction of posts, so counts are a floor, not a total."
      },
